<title>HONG KONG: Trade in East Asiatic shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in East Asiatic shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of shipping and wholesale group East Asiatic Co (Hong Kong) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
